     A*  DESCRIPTION:  THIS IS THE WORK FILE TO HOLD THE DATA FOR     *
     A*                POC NOTICES.  A SUB FILE, WXPOP2, WILL HOLD    *
     A*                ADDITIONAL LOCATIONS THAT MAY NEED TO PRINT.   *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PPO012                    TEXT('POC NOTICE WORKFILE')
     A*
     A* KEY FIELDS
     A*
     A            PO2XML        60A         COLHDG('XML FILE NAME')
     A*
     A            PO2KEY         9S 0
     A                                      COLHDG('INCREMENTING' 'KEY')
     A*
     A            PO2NAME      120A
     A                                      COLHDG('LOCATION NAME')
     A*
     A            PO2ADR1   R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('LOCATION ADDRESS 1')
     A            PO2ADR2   R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('LOCATION ADDRESS 2')
     A            PO2CITY   R               REFFLD(CTY)
     A                                      COLHDG('LOCATION' 'CITY')
     A            PO2ST     R               REFFLD(ST)
     A                                      COLHDG('LOCATION' 'STATE')
     A            PO2ZIP    R     S         REFFLD(ZIP)
     A                                      COLHDG('LOCATION' 'ZIP CODE')
     A*
     A* MAINTENANCE FIELDS
     A*
     A            PO2USER   R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('USER')
     A            PO2PGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM')
     A            PO2TIME   R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME')
     A            PO2DT     R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE')
     A*
